Package: libgtk-3-0
Version: @DEB_LIBGTK_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.gtk.org/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libpango-1.0-0, libatk1.0-0, libcairo2, libcairo-gobject2, libepoxy0, libfribidi0, libfontconfig1, libharfbuzz0b, libx11-6, libxext6, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxcursor1, libxfixes3, libxdamage1, libxinerama1, libxrender1, libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libgtkintl
Description: GTK graphical user interface library
 GTK is a multi-platform toolkit for creating graphical user interfaces.
 Offering a complete set of widgets, GTK is suitable for projects ranging from
 small one-off tools to complete application suites.
 .
 This package contains the shared libraries, input method and print modules
 for the X11 and Wayland backends.
